    "Relay can’t minimize the window until you grant Accessibility access. Open System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility and enable Relay, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你授予辅助功能权限之前，Relay 无法最小化窗口。请打开「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 辅助功能」并启用 Relay，然后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你授予輔助使用權限之前，Relay 無法最小化視窗。請開啟「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 輔助使用」並啟用 Relay，然後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
